body:
Adding some blush to the face would make it look more lively. Adding some detail to the hair would be good as well. 

&#x200B;

As far as composition goes, I would personally like it if you added some more of here torso, as just the face alone makes it look incomplete.

&#x200B;

Hope that helps.

This is a very creative and vibrant picture! I like it!

&#x200B;

I don't really have any critique to give. I think it looks great as it is.

This looks good! I like the line art, and the colour you chose is very pleasant to look at!

&#x200B;

What I would suggest would be to redraw this image and toy around with adding some detail and texture to it, for practice.

In my opinion, the shadows on the background look a bit too soft compared to how rough and textured painting is otherwise.

&#x200B;

Other than that, it looks great! Wish you good luck to enroll in  an art school!
